# design staging payloads (see doc/staging/README.md)
# Everything inside these folders is ignored; the folders persist in a
# working tree once created. Use `git add -f <path>` to track a specific
# file deliberately.
doc/staging/colors/*
doc/staging/images/*
doc/staging/resume/*
doc/staging/references/*
doc/staging/notes/*
doc/staging/tools/*

*.
!bun.lock

